WEBVTT

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.060
It's a robot.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:23.860
It's a machine.

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.900
But it's a wind.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:31.990
Just

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:33.830
One

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:34.170
Two

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:37.550
Three

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.060
He will be appointed Commander-in-Chief of the Seven Great Battalions.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:04.680
Yes, sir.

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:08.780
I am grateful for the favor you have bestowed upon me.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.920
I am grateful for the favor you have bestowed upon me.

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:31.430
This is the end of the oath of oath.

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:36.800
With so much power in the air,

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.680
you're still fighting like the Great Majingers.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.540
It's because your strategy is weak.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:46.850
After I take office, I won't allow any mistakes in my strategy.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:50.230
Those who make a mistake will be executed immediately.

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:55.760
I want to see the best of you.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.520
Captain, there's a monster in the sky above Mt. Fuji.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:08.650
It's 10,000 meters high. It's an intrusion.

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:09.680
I'll go look for it.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:10.650
Be careful.

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:29.580
Don't let it get away.

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:34.100
I'm a robot, so I'll run.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:35.660
This is it.

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:36.660
Oh!

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:46.860
Yuka!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:16.710
I'll kill you, genius!

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:00.560
Was he killed by a battle beast?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:06.020
That's right!

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:20.400
The Great Mazinger is not immortal.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:24.090
Look, the data that Granius has collected proves it.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.950
Your Excellency, we have the weak data of the Great Mazinger.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.560
Can I trust your data?

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:34.580
That's too much.

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:37.980
Hey, shut up! I have my own way of doing things!

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:44.280
Look at me, Great Mazinger!

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:47.280
So this is the new battle beast.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:49.880
That tail-cutter looks like a pretty powerful weapon.

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:51.990
Chief, where's Tetsuya?

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.570
He went to that girl's house.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:54.510
Again?

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:56.080
It's about Tetsuya.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.510
He'll be fine if he's not misunderstood.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.960
You're not here every day, are you?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.820
No. How are you, Kaori?

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:10.760
I haven't been able to talk to you since then.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:18.820
John was a gift from his late husband for her birthday.

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:23.350
That's why he's so important to you.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:24.100
That's right.

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:25.850
I'm sorry.

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:28.530
No, it's not your fault.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.850
Here's your souvenir, a set of beads.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.860
Kaori, you've been wanting one for a long time.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.420
I'm glad you like it.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:42.130
Kaori!

00:07:58.950 --> 00:07:59.270
I know that.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.260
Isn't it strange that she won't even say a word?

00:08:02.530 --> 00:08:04.290
Maybe it's her insincerity.

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:08.160
Insincerity? Does it mean she can't speak?

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.040
Yes, it's a psychological shock.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.770
Will it heal?

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:14.920
It's temporary.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:16.580
I don't think she'll worry about it.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.570
But the problem is somewhere else.

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:21.290
That's right.

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:24.150
Kaori's heart is full of hatred for the Great Majinger.

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:27.480
Her heart was kinder than anyone else.

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:29.430
But after Aiken died...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.840
It's like a cold cold feeling like a cold heart.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:42.980
What? What?

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.180
You don't have to worry about that.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.280
I'm going to do it like you.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.160
It's easy to say.

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:49.540
It's easy to say.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.000
Well, let's give it to me.

00:09:04.924 --> 00:09:05.424
No!

00:09:05.468 --> 00:09:06.628
What did you say?

00:09:06.972 --> 00:09:08.632
I sent it to the police, but...

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:31.260
You

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:01.620
Hey, hey.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:03.450
Hey.

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:05.540
Hey.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:36.940
I wonder where Kaori-chan went.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:41.590
Oh, there she is!

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:44.730
Kaori-chan!

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:48.650
Kaori-chan, your mother is worried.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:50.770
Where on earth did she go?

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:53.180
Kaori-chan!

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:58.160
I've found a replacement!

00:10:59.080 --> 00:10:59.480
Here!

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:02.820
I'll give this to Kaori.

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:04.840
So please forgive Tetsuya.

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:16.100
It's really painful!

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:35.740
What am I supposed to do?

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:39.950
What am I supposed to do to bring Kaori back to her original kind heart?

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.410
What am I supposed to do?

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:46.060
I understand how Tetsuya feels, but it's too serious.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:47.940
You're telling me not to worry?

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.750
You're telling me it's not a problem to worry about?

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:55.330
For Kaori, John was like a Great Mazinger to me.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:58.020
I don't want to fight anymore.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:11.140
Captain General, take Granius away and leave immediately.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.800
Yes, sir! I'll do as you say!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:26.400
For that girl, even Tetsuya-onii-chan became like that!

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:37.640
The enemy is heading to the research facility.

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:52.100
Tetsuya, let's go!

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:54.660
Let's wait for Jun to bring the battle guns.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:55.320
What?

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:57.060
Jun's coming!

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:58.620
Tetsuya!

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:02.060
I don't feel like fighting.

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:03.800
What are you talking about?

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:06.980
Try to defeat the battle ship on your own once in a while.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:09.180
I understand. I'm leaving.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:10.560
I'm counting on you.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:41.170
What's wrong with you?

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:42.620
What's wrong with Jun?

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:42.880
What?

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:44.220
Don't just sit there and eat!

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:46.440
It's dangerous!

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.170
You can't do that in the air.

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:21.430
You have to take it to the ground.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:31.110
Hey, you wanna

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:31.370
What?

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:56.510
I'm watching!

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:59.840
I'm watching!

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:16.960
Since Tetsuya won't move, Jun will be fighting alone!

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:36.700
In the forest of hell

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:43.040
In the forest of green

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:28.720
Tetsuya, you've been treating Jun like a brother since you were little.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:44.300
If this continues, not only Jun, but even the Bosses will die!

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:46.100
Tetsuya-kun!

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:52.940
Yes, Tetsuya-kun!

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:12.530
Start!

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:35.250
The Great Majinger's spirit will reach Kaori-chan as soon as she hears the news.

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:38.130
Her heart will be as bright as ever.

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:44.320
Aim for the wings of the Great Majinger!

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:48.570
Yes, Grandius! Destroy the wings!

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.710
The command post on the Japanese side is weaker than anywhere else!

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.490
Concentrate on attacking it!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:07.250
Yes, sir!

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:15.210
Tetsuya-kun!

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:29.380
Tetsuya-kun is...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:30.480
I'm trying to make it up to Kaori-chan.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:32.850
Make it up?

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:39.350
I'm trying to make Kaori-chan suffer the same as John.

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:40.920
I'm trying to make her forgive me.

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:06.620
Thank you.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:35.610
I got it! Kaori got it!

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:45.180
I'll double the needle and give it back to you!

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:52.650
Atomic Top Boomerang!

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.480
I'm not the Great Majinger you think I am!

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.400
Backspin Kick!

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:11.640
Knee Impulse Kick!

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:52.200
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha! This is good enough!

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:54.860
The fact that you drove the Great Majinger all the way there

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:56.740
is proof that my plan was not in vain!

00:21:57.760 --> 00:21:59.970
With this, the Great Maji-

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.900
I'm confident that I can defeat Ginga.

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:11.390
I'm glad that you've regained your kind heart, Kaori.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:11.850
That's right.

00:22:12.210 --> 00:22:14.550
By overcoming your sorrows one by one,

00:22:14.610 --> 00:22:16.310
you will become a person with a strong and rich heart.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:19.700
You must remember this very well.

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:21.040
Yes.

00:22:29.580 --> 00:22:29.900
What's wrong?

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.520
This is the best!

00:22:32.800 --> 00:22:33.160
It's true!

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:47.350
But...

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:49.320
It's reflected in Kaori-chan's eyes.

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:02.890
Now, hold on tight!

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:05.410
Let's go!

00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:39.900
Chizuki is here

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:46.620
Anare-shama-ga

00:23:46.620 --> 00:23:48.180
Seichika

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:29.880
Under the orders of the Emperor, Chief Officer Argos and Yanus...

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.640
In order to save Dr. Kabuto's life,

00:24:32.020 --> 00:24:36.040
Dr. Kabuto managed to lure Helena and the Cattle Army into the research facility.

00:24:37.400 --> 00:24:40.310
The research facility was quiet before the storm.

00:24:40.630 --> 00:24:44.360
Dr. Kabuto, how will Great Maginger fight?

00:24:45.040 --> 00:24:46.710
Next time on Great Maginger,

00:24:46.910 --> 00:24:48.020
at 3 a.m.

00:24:48.520 --> 00:24:50.660
Please look forward to the assassination of Dr. Kabuto.
